OL,3,GNEWSA'You feel that you're not alone' -
OL,4,Athe young people finding community in
OL,5,Agrief
OL,6,
OL,7,FLuke Alfano was 21 when his dad, who
OL,8,Fjust two weeks earlier had been
OL,9,Fdiagnosed with cancer, died.
OL,11,FAt the time, Luke did not know what to
OL,12,Fdo or where to turn.
OL,14,FFive years later, he founded Too Young
OL,15,Fto Grieve, a community offering young
OL,16,Fpeople a casual space to "have a moan,
OL,17,Fhave a laugh, talk about your grief and
OL,18,Fjust know that people understand you".
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
