OL,3,GNEWSA'You feel that you're not alone' -
OL,4,Athe young people finding community in
OL,5,Agrief
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe group is based in more than 20
OL,8,Flocations, including London,
OL,9,FManchester, the US and Australia - and
OL,10,Fnow, Belfast.
